      "description": "【寝取り寝取られ2パターン　ゲーム版　FRIENDS】\n\n女優:上泉 伊都葉\n\nCV:倉浪あお\n\n【内容】\n\n寒い冬の時期、部活で学校帰りの三人はテツヲの家に遊びに行くことになる\n\n主人公はコンビニにお菓子を買いに行かされ、伊都葉とテツヲは部屋でイチャつく\n\n買い物から帰る主人公がそっとドアを開けると二人の営みを目撃するがいったん外へ\n\n間を見計らって部屋へ入るとすでに終わってテツヲは疲れ果てコタツで寝ている\n\n伊都葉と主人公は一緒にゲームするがセックスへと発展\n\n寝ているテツヲの横で・・・\n\n本作品は【英語】【中国語】字幕のON、OFF表示機能が付いています。\n\nActress:Itoha Kamiizumi\n\nVoice actor:Ao Kuranami\n\n[story]\n\nOne day during the cold winter months, the three of them decide to go to Tetsuo's apartment after their club activities have ended.\n\nThe main character gets sent on an errand to the convenience store for snacks. While he's away, Itoha and Tetsuo begin making out.\n\nWhen the main character gets back from the store, he opens the door to find the two of them having sex and quickly runs back out.\n\nAfter waiting for them to finish, he enters again to find Tetsuo asleep at the kotatsu table, exhausted.\n\nItoha and the main character play a game. But it soon leads to them having sex\n\nright beside the sleeping Tetsuo.\n\nThis work has an ON and OFF display function for [English] and [Chinese] subtitles\n\n(Text: English / Voice: Japanese)\n\n(Text: 中文/ Voice: 日语)\n\n(English product description provided by the creator.)\n\n更新情報履歴をもっと見る\n\n作品をもっと見る",
